  "description": "An EditorConfig-inspired, INI-backed configuration document model for .NET with independent parse, resolve, and write phases. ConfigurationDocument.Parse turns source text into an IniDocument, .Resolve(targetPath) projects it into a ConfigurationView, and typed view getters read values back. Ships coherent profiles (Bodu, EditorConfigCompatible, Strict, Relaxed) that select matching parse, resolve, and write defaults.",
